 kw='Primary: evacuation wheelchair (80/mo, KD8). Secondary: wheelchair evacuation chair (20), evac chair 600h (10). Ricky\'s note: dual-position model per the product copy; KD8 is the highest in this set. Andrew\'s note (Tab 1): we do not sell an evacuation wheelchair, so the term is used to explain what the chair does instead.',
